    /// Reset one USB device.
    ///
    /// Request one bus-level reset for one opened USB device.
    ///
    /// # Platform
    /// Unix and Windows.
    /// Uses host USB reset-device APIs where available.
    ///
    /// # Errors
    /// Returns invalidArgument, ioNotFound, ioPermissionDenied, ioWouldBlock, notSupported.
    ///
    /// # Security
